  "descriptionHtml": "<div data-page-id=\"JXZCdSf4souOhxxVP0ccqejonHb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line text-indent ace-line old-record-id-LyMadJHbeooNzIxYz5acsEt2nRb\">Specced for the experienced trail and enduro rider who refuses to compromise on ride quality, the Current LTD is the uncompromised expression of Aventon's full-suspension platform. It pairs flagship-tier suspension, drivetrain, brakes, and wheels with the same Aventon Ultro X motor and ACU Smart Bike Ecosystem that define the entire Current line. Only 99 exist worldwide. Limited edition paint and individually numbered frames make this bike not only a joy to ride, but also a collector's item.</div>\n</div><h2>Buying your Aventon from Quest Watersports</h2><ul><li>Every e-bike purchased through Quest Watersports includes a <strong>$160 assembly and tuning fee</strong>.</li><li>Colors and sizes we don't have in stock can be special ordered. Call 815.433.2200 or request info below.</li><li>Financing is available through Synchrony, subject to credit approval.</li></ul>",
